  "draw_notes": [
    "All coordinates and z are logical stage units at either resolution. Resolve files against roxy3d/out10p/.",
    "No layer is \"under\": push every render_layer into the occluder stack (img.prop) at its z_index, AFTER out10, out10m and out10l, so that at equal z it is later in the document.",
    "Bodies are straight-alpha source-over and carry the contact shadow (black with alpha) outside the silhouette. Light pieces are RGB on black, plus-lighter.",
    "tv_body carries the popcorn machine pixels in front of the TV (same pack slice as the worktop). Draw the TV picture into props.tv.screen_quad above tv_body.",
    "Animated pieces: layers with \"anim\". Everything else is always on.",
    "parents is empty: no piece is split into slices."
  ],
